BlackRock Inc. has officially taken over management responsibilities for $80 billion in assets for Citigroup’s private banking clients globally.&nbsp;

The partnership, which the firms are calling Citi Portfolio Solutions powered by BlackRock, is one of the largest deals of its kind. BlackRock already managed more than $600 billion in client investments and, through the deal, took over
